---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Explorer from '../components/Explorer.astro';
---
<Layout><section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> BIG PLANS? YOU’RE IN THE RIGHT PLACE.</span><h1>Your life.<br/>Your <span class="highlight">move.<svg viewBox="0 0 400 30" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 20Q180 0 393 13M60 28Q250 10 365 21"/></svg></span></h1><p>First salary. Next adventure. Something of your own.<br class="desktop"/> Get a little backup for everything you’re becoming.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#explore">Find your thing <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Let’s figure it out <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="hero-proof"><div class="proof-icons"><Icon name="Protection"/><Icon name="Wealth"/><Icon name="Mobility"/></div><p><strong>27 ways to move forward.</strong><br/>One SAMA by your side.</p></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><div class="hero-image"><img src="/friends.webp" alt="Three young friends laughing together on a sunny city rooftop" width="1448" height="1086" fetchpriority="high"/></div><div class="hero-sticker">MORE LIFE.<br/>LESS WHAT IF.<span>✳</span></div><a class="floating-link" href="/products/travel/"><span class="floating-icon"><Icon name="travel"/></span><span>Next stop?<strong>Anywhere you want.</strong></span><b>↗</b></a><div class="photo-caption"><span></span> HERE FOR YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</div></div></section><div class="ticker" aria-label="Protection. Possibility. Freedom. Your way."><button class="ticker-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Pause moving text" aria-pressed="false">Ⅱ</button><div class="ticker-track"><span>PROTECT YOUR WORLD <b>✳</b> FUND YOUR PLANS <b>✳</b> OWN YOUR FUTURE <b>✳</b> DO LIFE YOUR WAY <b>✳</b></span><span aria-hidden="true">PROTECT YOUR WORLD <b>✳</b> FUND YOUR PLANS <b>✳</b> OWN YOUR FUTURE <b>✳</b> DO LIFE YOUR WAY <b>✳</b></span></div></div>
<section class="wrap goal-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">WHAT’S THE PLAN?</span><h2>Big main-character<br/><span>energy. Real-life backup.</span></h2></div><p>You bring the ambition.<br/>We’ll help you explore the options.</p></div><div class="goal-grid"><a class="goal-card goal-protect" href="/services/?category=Protection"><Icon name="Protection"/><span class="goal-tag">FOR YOUR PEACE OF MIND</span><h3>Cover your<br/>kind of life.</h3><div>Explore protection <span>↗</span></div></a><a class="goal-card goal-wealth" href="/services/?category=Wealth"><Icon name="Wealth"/><span class="goal-tag">FOR FUTURE YOU</span><h3>Small starts.<br/>Big possibilities.</h3><div>Explore wealth <span>↗</span></div></a><a class="goal-card goal-borrow" href="/services/?category=Borrowing"><Icon name="Borrowing"/><span class="goal-tag">FOR THAT NEXT BIG THING</span><h3>Make someday<br/>a real plan.</h3><div>Explore borrowing <span>↗</span></div></a></div></section>
<Explorer compact/>
<section class="approach" id="approach"><div class="wrap approach-grid"><div class="approach-title"><span class="eyebrow">LESS “IT’S COMPLICATED.” MORE “GOT IT.”</span><h2>Adulting.<br/><span>With a little</span><br/>backup.</h2><p>Money decisions can feel like a lot. We’re here to help you ask the right questions, understand your options and find your next step.</p><a class="button lime" href="/contact/">Find your starting point ↗</a></div><div class="steps">{[['01','Your goals. Zero guesswork.','Start with what you want from life. A new ride, a safety net or a plan for the years ahead.','All'],['02','Straight talk. Clear choices.','Understand the costs, conditions and details that matter before making your decision.','cibil'],['03','Your pace. Your call.','Take the next step when you’re ready, with guidance on what to prepare and how to proceed.','claims']].map(([n,h,p,icon])=><article class="step"><div class="step-top"><Icon name={icon}/><span>{n} / 03</span></div><h3>{h}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section class="wrap spotlight"><div class="spotlight-copy"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR FIRST STEP DOESN’T HAVE TO BE HUGE</span><h2>Start somewhere.<br/><span>Go somewhere.</span></h2><p>You don’t need a perfect five-year plan. Pick what’s on your mind today.</p></div><div class="spotlight-links">{[['travel','That trip in the group chat.','Explore travel cover'],['education','The course. The city. The next you.','Explore education loans'],['mutual-fund','A little something for future me.','Explore mutual funds']].map(([id,title,label])=><a href={`/products/${id}/`}><span class="spot-icon"><Icon name={id}/></span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{label}</p></div><b>↗</b></a>)}</div></section>
<section class="wrap faq" id="questions"><div><span class="eyebrow">NO QUESTION TOO BASIC</span><h2>Wait.<br/><span>What about…?</span></h2><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Ask us your question ↗</a></div><div>{[['I’m new to this. Where do I start?','That’s a good place to be. Pick a goal from the collection, or start a conversation about what’s on your mind. You don’t need to know which product you want yet.'],['Is SAMA only about insurance?','There’s more to explore: 27 services across protection, borrowing, wealth, mobility and everyday essentials. All in one place.'],['Do I have to commit to anything?','An enquiry is just a starting point. You choose whether to apply or purchase after reviewing the applicable terms and requirements.'],['Can I get help with something I already have?','Yes. Tell us about the product or question in your enquiry. Keep sensitive account, policy and identity details out of the initial message.']].map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}<span>+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section><section class="closing"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">YOU’VE GOT A LIFE TO LIVE.</span><h2>Make your<br/><span>next move.</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></h2><a class="button white" href="/contact/">Let’s get into it <span>↗</span></a><p>A conversation is a pretty good start.</p></div></section></Layout>

<script>const pause=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.ticker-toggle');pause?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const paused=pause.getAttribute('aria-pressed')!=='true';pause.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(paused));pause.setAttribute('aria-label',paused?'Resume moving text':'Pause moving text');pause.textContent=paused?'▶':'Ⅱ';document.querySelector('.ticker')?.classList.toggle('paused',paused)});</script>
